ne-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFFoster2019\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Foster, Kendrick (20 September 2019). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://hir.harvard.edu/matatus-mototaxis-and-more/\">\"Matatus, Mototaxis, and More: Paratransit and Inequality\"</a>. <i>Harvard International Review</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">10 March</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Harvard+International+Review&amp;rft.atitle=Matatus%2C+Mototaxis%2C+and+More%3A+Paratransit+and+Inequality&amp;rft.date=2019-09-20&amp;rft.aulast=Foster&amp;rft.aufirst=Kendrick&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fhir.harvard.edu%2Fmatatus-mototaxis-and-more%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ANairobi\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-9\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFMairura&#95;Omwenga\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Mairura Omwenga. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.isocarp.net/data/case_studies/2022.pdf\">\"Integrated Transport System for Liveable City Environment: A Case Study of Nairobi Kenya\"</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span>. <i>www.isocarp.net</i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160303194404/http://www.isocarp.net/data/case_studies/2022.pdf\">Archived</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> from the original on 3 March 2016<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">6 May</span> 2017</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitl